flowchart LR
    Cam([Webcam]) --> MP[MediaPipe Heavy<br/>33 keypoints 2D]
    MP --> Lift[TemporalLifter<br/>2D to 3D 15 joints]
    Lift --> Ang[3D Angle Calc<br/>hip / knee / trunk]
    Ang --> Score[Weighted Rule-based<br/>Scoring]
    Score --> OX[O/X Verdict<br/>Accuracy Pct]
    OX --> LLM{Online?}
    LLM -- Yes --> Gemini[Gemini 2.5 Flash<br/>Friendly Coach Prompt]
    LLM -- No --> Off[Offline Template<br/>Friendly Rule-based]
    Gemini --> UI3[3-Panel UI]
    Off --> UI3
    UI3 --> Show([User Cam +<br/>Expert Video +<br/>Score Panel])
    Show --> Cam

    classDef new fill:#D4FFB5,stroke:#339933,stroke-width:2px
    classDef key fill:#FFE4B5,stroke:#cc6600,stroke-width:2px
    class Score,OX,Off,UI3 new
    class Lift,Gemini key
